[gd_scene format=3]

; Dad's flashlight, dropped and still burning. Built from primitives (there is
; no flashlight prop). Lies along local Z with the lens at -Z, so the beam
; points wherever the node's -Z points. Centre of the body at the origin.
; Scenery only: no collision, no text, no interaction.

